        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/4a3e220fbaf4f95a75a23ca6d414d902.avif?t=1786271353\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Flowers: Tiny Starlight </strong>is a story-driven puzzle game where players embody the protagonist on a post-apocalyptic journey of self-reconciliation, enduring solitary struggles within a time loop. A millennium after the meteor catastrophe, magic has gradually become an instrument of control for the powerful. You awaken amidst ruins teeming with zombies, stripped of all past memories—remembering only that instinct-driven fireball spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on adventures with your former companions once more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an unfamiliar yet strangely familiar city, where echoes of the past guide your way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fireball! Launch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim your magic, banish the evil, and escape the town shrouded in mist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ponder and solve the puzzle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues and hints to solve various mechanisms and puzzles, and unravel the ultimate truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed-Area Combat Mechanics: </strong>In designated enemy zones, press <strong>Z</strong> to cast fireballs at targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management: </strong>Fireball casting consumes <strong>MP</strong>. Restore HP/MP by sleeping in beds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production</strong>: Xiao Qi, Completed independently by a single person.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/4a3e220fbaf4f95a75a23ca6d414d902.avif?t=1786271353\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Flowers: Tiny Starlight </strong>is a story-driven puzzle game where players embody the protagonist on a post-apocalyptic journey of self-reconciliation, enduring solitary struggles within a time loop. A millennium after the meteor catastrophe, magic has gradually become an instrument of control for the powerful. You awaken amidst ruins teeming with zombies, stripped of all past memories—remembering only that instinct-driven fireball spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on adventures with your former companions once more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an unfamiliar yet strangely familiar city, where echoes of the past guide your way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/0e3bebd5c1968e85ee4f18d5dfebff3a.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fireball! Launch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim your magic, banish the evil, and escape the town shrouded in mist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/57a99d32b97f9ad133830001f40cc039.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ponder and solve the puzzle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues and hints to solve various mechanisms and puzzles, and unravel the ultimate truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.poster.avif?t=1786271353\" width=300 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.webm?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875630/extras/2b7732a6ddab8dd55d528ad82ae8273e.mp4?t=1786271353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed-Area Combat Mechanics: </strong>In designated enemy zones, press <strong>Z</strong> to cast fireballs at targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management: </strong>Fireball casting consumes <strong>MP</strong>. Restore HP/MP by sleeping in beds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production</strong>: Xiao Qi, Completed independently by a single person.</p></li></ul>",
